# Core Skills

Project skills: `.cursor/skills/`. Agents: `.cursor/agents/`.

When the task matches, **read and follow** the corresponding `SKILL.md` (or agent file) before coding:

| Trigger | Skill / agent |
|---------|----------------|
| New feature end-to-end | `feature-dev` |
| Change existing feature | `change-request` |
| Bug / error / regression | `bugfix` |
| BA analysis / requirements | `business-analyst` |
| Mobile UI Spec from BA | `ui-ux-design` |
| Task breakdown from BA | `tech-lead` |
| Screen / widget / l10n | `flutter-ui` |
| Drift / ledger / Riverpod data | `flutter-data` |
| Tests / QA / verify | `test-qa` |
| Refactor without behavior change | `agents/refactor` |
| Perf / jank / slow DB | `perf-review` |
| Drift query efficiency | `drift-query` |
| User-facing guide | `user-guide` |

Explore code via **graphify** first (see `graphify.mdc`).
